            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.0.7

- Fixed Pattern Pi startup incorrectly timing out when its home page redirects to login. Weft now checks Pi's dedicated health endpoint, so readiness does not depend on a browser login session.
- The Open Pi button still opens the application home page. Existing built-in Pattern Pi projects receive the corrected health check when Weft relaunches.
]]></description>
